flowchart TB
  Role[Room role base permissions<br/>creator / admin / member / guest]
  RoomAdd[Room settings<br/>added_permissions]
  RoomRemove[Room settings<br/>removed_permissions]
  MemberAdd[Member override<br/>added_permissions]
  MemberRemove[Member override<br/>removed_permissions]
  Effective[Final effective permissions]
  Creator[creator special case<br/>always has all room permissions]

  Role --> RoomAdd --> RoomRemove --> MemberAdd --> MemberRemove --> Effective
  Creator -. cannot be weakened .-> Effective

  RoomRemove -. if a bit is both added and removed<br/>remove wins .-> Effective
  MemberRemove -. last override layer .-> Effective
